# Over-broad annotation on inner fn nested inside an unannotated outer fn
# walk_for_functions must recurse into unannotated fn bodies so T012 is emitted
# for the inner @Number annotation even though the outer fn has no return annotation.
[outer: [fn [let x] [fn@Number [let y@Integer] y]]]
=== out
Dict({"outer": Function(x)})

=== warn
inferred type is Unknown — consider adding a type annotation
annotation @Number is over-broad — inferred type is Int; consider using @Integer
